      "writtenOn": "2022-11-02T12:52:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Actually, I think this probably needs to look like\n\n```\n    const Expression* initialValue \u003d GetConstantValueForVariable(*varDecl.value());\n    if (Analysis::IsCompileTimeConstant(initialValue)) { return; }\n```",
