      "writtenOn": "2022-11-02T20:57:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Doesn\u0027t `GetConstantValueForVariable` only work on a `VariableReference`? What I have here is a `VarDeclaration` which is why I reimplemented the logic from there. Unless, GetConstantValueForVariable should also support VarDeclarations?",
      "parentUuid": "5d7a499a_1d95e773",
