      "writtenOn": "2022-11-02T22:24:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I added some aliases to `resources/sksl/spirv/CompileTimeConstantVariables.sksl` in the latest patch set (PS5). From what I can tell the SPIR-V remains unchanged, metal and glsl end up with one global constant that\u0027s never referenced. AFAICT SPIR-V correct skips the OpVariable declaration for the aliases even without the `GetConstantValueForVariable` call and only the `Analysis::IsCompileTimeConstant(*initialValue)` check.\n\nI also noticed that I forgot to upload the generated files, so they are added now. PTAL.",
